---
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';
import WorksheetDirectory from '../../components/WorksheetDirectory.astro';
---
<Layout title="All Printable Math Worksheets | Math Worksheet Studio" description="Explore 51 printable math worksheet topics, organized by skill. Choose arithmetic, fractions, algebra or geometry and print matching PDF answer keys." canonicalPath="/worksheets/">
 <div class="container"><section class="hero hero-compact">
  <span class="eyebrow">Printable math practice library</span>
  <h1>Find the right math worksheet</h1>
  <p>Explore 51 established generators, a separate real-world word-problem generator and guided subject or grade collections. Choose a focused skill or navigate to the right practice tool.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="panel info-panel" data-geo-library-guide aria-labelledby="library-choice-heading">
  <span class="eyebrow">Choose by the question, not only the grade</span>
  <h2 id="library-choice-heading">Which printable math worksheet should I use?</h2>
  <p>Choose the generator that matches the work you want the learner to show. The same words can describe different mathematical tasks: a multiplication-facts sheet does not provide the written layout of long multiplication, and a volume worksheet does not calculate exposed surface area.</p>
  <ul>
   <li><strong>To practise a calculation method:</strong> use <a href="/two-digit-multiplication-worksheets/">two-digit multiplication</a> for written partial products, or <a href="/long-division-worksheets/">long division</a> for quotient-place working and remainders.</li>
   <li><strong>To practise fraction reasoning:</strong> use <a href="/equivalent-fractions-worksheets/">equivalent fractions</a> for equal-value forms, or <a href="/adding-unlike-fractions-worksheets/">unlike-denominator addition</a> for a common-denominator calculation.</li>
   <li><strong>To practise geometry:</strong> use <a href="/area-of-triangles-worksheets/">triangle area</a> for base and perpendicular height, <a href="/volume-of-rectangular-prisms-worksheets/">rectangular-prism volume</a> for cubic units, or <a href="/surface-area-worksheets/">surface area</a> for square units.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Every core topic has a reproducible student sheet and matching answer key. Worked steps are available only where the generator supports them. Read our <a href="/about/">worksheet generation and answer-check method</a> if you need to verify a tool before printing.</p>
  <p class="how-note">Practice guidance maintained by <a href="/about/">Math Worksheet Studio</a> · Updated November 8, 2026.</p>
 </section>
 </div>
 <WorksheetDirectory/>
</Layout>
